      "content": "hm, it feels like a lot of those \"control\" arguments get dismissed immediately as conspiracy theories though. even when people bring up legitimate things about government overreach or surveillance in smart cities. is it fair to just label those concerns as conspiracy theories, or is there more to it than that?",
